# Import allowlist of the kernel WASM reference module (spec node KRN.MAN.WASM, REQ-003).
# Format: `<module> <name> -- <justification>`; read by `fid-wasm-check imports`.
# Only function imports can be allowed. Nothing here gives the kernel a clock, randomness,
# the file system, sockets or the environment: values cannot depend on the host.

wasi_snapshot_preview1 fd_read -- reads the one canonical call from standard input (fd 0)
wasi_snapshot_preview1 fd_write -- writes the canonical result or error to standard output (fd 1)
wasi_snapshot_preview1 proc_exit -- ends the command with exit code 0, 1, 2 or 3
wasi_snapshot_preview1 args_get -- Rust std command start-up copies argv; the shim never reads it
wasi_snapshot_preview1 args_sizes_get -- Rust std command start-up sizes argv; the shim never reads it
wasi_snapshot_preview1 environ_get -- Rust std start-up copies environ; wasmtime passes none and the shim never reads it
wasi_snapshot_preview1 environ_sizes_get -- Rust std start-up sizes environ; wasmtime passes none and the shim never reads it
